es that have unique controls and meaningfully different styles.  There's lots of QoL improvements over the previous release, and this game is a genuine blast to play with friends (Co-op only, although there is friendly fire if you want to be \"that guy\").  \n\nMy only gripe is that the game carries a AAA price, and it's definitely not a AAA title.  Definitely recommend picking it up on sale if you can. \n\nPreviously, PS4 controllers wouldn't work with the title, but it seems that Steam pushed an update some time back that increased controller compatibility across the platform, so an emulator is no longer needed.", "timestamp_created": 1605320881, "timestamp_updated": 1702368297, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.509873449802398682", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79222667", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054153844", "personaname": "Melvin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MelvinTheMonster/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 17338, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8406, "last_played": 1721521597, "avatar": "4efe1e4699f427f3dac9a9bf9d66c9968d91db66"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is epic", "timestamp_created": 1605309098, "timestamp_updated": 1605309098, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.491593688726425171", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79155838", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995269847", "personaname": "Lockeee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995269847/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 5968, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3505, "last_played": 1708030473, "avatar": "4559e4549332a3c504922c5ae1dc9b2d153e5c37"}, "language": "english", "review": "What is Earth Defence Force 5? That's Easy. Big Guns, Big Insects, Aliens and sometimes Human looking Creatures (get it?) trying to Destroy our beloved Earth.\nNow it's up to you too pick the Weapon you like covering Miniguns, Space Weapons or even Air Strikes and get rid of them.\n\nYou can go for Singleplayer and have some Stupid Fun or imo grab up to 3 Friends and Jump in a 4 Player Online Co-Op Session and just enjoy endless Hours of Explosions and flying Enemy Body Parts.\n\nIt is Worth it, would recommend it too Everyone.", "timestamp_created": 1605198161, "timestamp_updated": 1605198161, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538418114185333252", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79120998", "author": {"steamid": "76561198373463270", "personaname": "Vb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198373463270/", "num_games_owned": 88, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 8001, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4193, "last_played": 1765474442, "avatar": "1339fea0a5fe22fb5e3c4f092b8cdd62d673ea60"}, "language": "english", "review": "this is a very good quality game. it is good for people who like playing offline or online campaigns,  cause that is what the game is mainly. it is overall good.", "timestamp_created": 1605130102, "timestamp_updated": 1605130102, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": f